<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Reynolds Metals cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Reynolds Metals cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co said it downgraded Reynolds Metals Co to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Reynolds closed Monday at 72-1/2.</p>
</text>
